OL,3,GNEWSABid made to oust Gloucester City
OL,4,ACouncil leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid has been made to oust the leader
OL,7,Fof the city council over claims of
OL,8,Ffinancial mismanagement and a lack of
OL,9,Ftransparency.
OL,11,FA motion of no confidence has been
OL,12,Fsubmitted against Gloucester City
OL,13,FCouncil's Jeremy Hilton which, if
OL,14,Fpassed, could see him removed as
OL,15,Fleader.
OL,17,FCouncillor Alastair Chambers, who
OL,18,Fsubmitted the item for next Thursday's
OL,19,Ffull council meeting, said Hilton had
OL,20,Fan "excuse for everything and takes
OL,21,Fresponsibility for absolutely nothing".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
