OL,3,GNEWSABid made to oust Gloucester City
OL,4,ACouncil leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FHilton said the motion was "precisely
OL,7,Fthe distraction Gloucester does not
OL,8,Fneed" and he claimed there was a
OL,9,Fdifference between "constructive
OL,10,Fchallenge" and "perpetuating political
OL,11,Fpsychodrama".
